'''FK Jūrnieks''' is a [[Latvia]]n [[football (soccer)|football]] club based in [[Riga]]. Founded in 1959, it initially became defunct in 1997. In 2017, the club got reinstated in Latvia's [[Latvian Second League|Second League]]. Since 2023, it has been relegated to the [[Latvian Third League]]."}}
